A release gate checks for it (see tools/gates.mjs); it is deliberately not
committed by a script, because fetching a licence on someone's behalf and
committing it unread is not how one takes on a licence.

scheme/snd-vscode.scm is loaded into Snd and forms part of the same program
when running.  Snd and s7 are by Bill Schottstaedt.  The command set and key
chords follow inf-snd.el by Michael Scholz.

third-party/s7 contains s7.c and s7.h, taken unmodified from snd-26.5 and
covered by their own licence, 0BSD -- see third-party/s7/README.md.  Snd
itself is not included; tools/build-snd.sh fetches it.
